# Agna Qel'a: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." Bot1's only other land is a Tundra (not basic,
# CR 205.4a) so its Agna Qel'a enters tapped; Bot2's Agna Qel'a beside its own Island enters untapped (positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Agna Qel'a
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Agna Qel'a
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Agna Qel'a.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Agna Qel'a.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Agna Qel'a.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Agna Qel'a.Tapped = false
